  "releaseNotes": "Add fourteen PW2 MSA signals and conservative per-battery charged/discharged energy and reactive-power projection. Fill TEDAPI maximum-power ratings using site power capped by usable inverter capability; expose nullable SystemStatus.InverterNominalUsablePower. Preserve existing public signatures, assembly identity and captured query signatures. See RELEASE-NOTES.md and LOCAL-ACCESS.md for availability and hardware limits.",
